<title>USA: Play-By-Play completes debt placecement.</title>
<headline>Play-By-Play completes debt placecement.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Play-By-Play Toys &amp; Novelties Inc said Friday it has completed the private placement of $15 million of its convertible debentures.</p>
<p>The debentures mature in seven years, pay interest monthly based on an annual rate of 8.0 percent and are convertible at $17 into Play-By-Play common shares, it said.</p>
<p>Mark Gawlik, president, said proceeds from the placement will be used for working capital.</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc acted as agent for the placement, it said.</p>
